#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:38
msgid "信息论：诊断架构瓶颈的工具"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:40
msgid "在开始改造之前，我们需要一个\"听诊器\"——能告诉你模型问题在哪的工具。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:42
msgid "这个听诊器来自信息论：**神经网络本质上是把输入信息压缩、变换、提取的过程**。信息在层层传递中会面临两个问题："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:44
msgid "信息漏斗：容量不够"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:46
msgid "想象一个沙漏——上宽下窄。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:49
msgid "信息漏斗：容量瓶颈"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:98
msgid ""
"数据从 3072 维压到 256 "
"维，每压缩一次就丢失一些信息。如果网络太\"窄\"（通道数太少），就像漏斗的口太小——还没提取够就挤过去了。这就是**容量不够**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:100
msgid "梯度消失：传不过去"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:102
msgid "另一种问题更隐蔽：**信息量够，但传不回来**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:104
msgid "想象一个传话游戏——100 个人，每人说一遍。理论上每个人都能说清楚，但实际上第 1 个人的话传到第 100 个人时早已面目全非。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:106
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{ref}`gradient-vanishing` "
"中讨论过：梯度是各层影响的乘积。层数一多，浅层的梯度就像在传话游戏中一样，衰减到几乎为零。这就是**信息传不过去**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:110
msgid "互信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:112
msgid "在深入讨论之前，我们需要一个信息论的核心概念：**互信息（Mutual Information）**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:114
msgid "I(X; Y) = H(X) - H(X|Y)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:116
msgid "**直觉理解**：互信息衡量的是\"知道 $Y$ 后，$X$ 的不确定性减少了多少\"。在神经网络中："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:118
msgid "$X$：输入数据"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:119
msgid "$Y$：模型输出或中间层特征"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:120
msgid "$I(X;Y)$：模型保留了多少输入信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:122
msgid "互信息越大，说明模型从输入中提取并保留了更多相关信息。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:124
msgid "用互信息诊断网络：一个具体例子"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:126
msgid ""
"想象你要设计一个分类网络，输入是 $32\\times32$ 的 CIFAR-10 图像（3072 维），输出是 10 "
"个类别。我们来看看互信息如何帮你诊断问题。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:128
msgid "场景一：容量不够"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:130
msgid "你设计了一个\"极简\"网络："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:132
msgid "1 个卷积层（3→8 通道）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:133
msgid "全局平均池化 → 10 维输出"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:135
msgid "计算互信息："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:137
msgid "输入熵 $H(X)$：CIFAR-10 图像的信息量，约 3072 比特（假设每个像素独立）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:138
msgid "中间表示：卷积后 $28\\times28\\times8 = 6272$ 个数值，看似比输入还大"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:139
msgid "但实际有效信息：只有 8 个通道，每个通道是一个\"特征图\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:141
msgid ""
"问题在哪？8 个通道意味着网络只能用 8 个\"模式\"来描述所有图像。CIFAR-10 有 10 个类别，每个类别有不同的纹理、形状、颜色——8"
" 个模式远远不够。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:143
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"从互信息角度：$I(X; \\hat{Y})$ 的上限是 8 比特（因为中间表示只有 8 个通道的特征），而分类 10 个类别需要 "
"$\\log_2(10) \\approx 3.3$ 比特——看似够，但每个类别内部还有巨大变化（同一类别的不同图像差异很大）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:145
msgid ""
"**信息瓶颈的量化**：如果瓶颈层只有 256 维（如 ResNet 的最后特征层），而你需要区分的类别有 1000 "
"个（ImageNet），每个类别平均只能分到 0.256 维的\"特征预算\"——这显然不够。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:147
msgid "场景二：信息传不过去"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:149
msgid "你设计了一个很深的网络：50 层，每层都是标准卷积+ReLU，没有跳跃连接。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:151
msgid "前向传播时："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:153
msgid "第 1 层能看到原始图像，信息丰富"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:154
msgid "第 10 层还能保留大部分信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:155
msgid "第 50 层：由于 ReLU 的截断效应和多次非线性变换，很多输入信息已经\"丢失\"了"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:157
msgid "反向传播时："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:159
msgid "损失对第 50 层的梯度很清晰"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:160
msgid "传到第 40 层开始衰减"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:161
msgid "传到第 1 层几乎为零"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:163
msgid "互信息视角："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:165
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$I(X; h_{50})$：输入与第 50 层特征的互信息——由于逐层变换，这个值可能很小"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:166
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$I(h_{50}; \\hat{Y})$：第 50 层与输出的互信息——如果 $h_{50}$ 已经丢失了关键信息，这个值也上不去"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part1-intro.md:168
msgid "这就是退化问题：网络很深，但浅层学不到东西，深层也提取不到好特征。"
msgstr ""

